</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1255) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> clips whose picture starts a moment after their sound couldn't be shared or exported (“Cannot Open”).</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
